<item><title>South Sudan delays elections to February 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-delays-elections-to-february-2027-39ae81/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-delays-elections-to-february-2027-39ae81/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The delay was blamed on ongoing political strife and flare-ups of violence, with voter registration complicated because many South Sudanese lack state-recognized identification.</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:53:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>South Sudan begins voter registration amid logistical strain</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-begins-voter-registration-amid-logistical-strain-fbd1b0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-begins-voter-registration-amid-logistical-strain-fbd1b0/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The National Elections Commission must deliver materials to remote areas within a two-week window before the February 11, 2027 vote.</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:34:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>South Sudan, Sudan sign oil deal</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-sudan-sign-oil-deal-ff18c5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-sudan-sign-oil-deal-ff18c5/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The two nations agreed to reconcile crude oil volumes and boost cooperation in the petroleum sector by June 2027.</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:32:01 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>South Sudan&apos;s elections moved to February 11, 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-s-elections-moved-to-february-11-2027-e2e680/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-s-elections-moved-to-february-11-2027-e2e680/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The National Elections Commission&apos;s revised calendar sets polling nearly two months past the December 2026 deadline in the election law.</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:56:53 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
